{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"50bf9b1ce2008ea219f7dc52ed37c0207386446e1e99fe1fc090811ce936fa2e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["服從政府的權柄"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["人人都要服從執掌權柄的，因為所有的權柄都是出於上帝。所有掌權的都是上帝設立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所以，抗拒掌權者，就是抗拒上帝的命令，抗拒的人必自招懲罰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["掌權的不是叫行善的懼怕，而是叫作惡的懼怕。你想不怕掌權的嗎？就要行善，這樣你會得到他的稱讚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為掌權的是上帝的僕人，對你有益處。然而，你若作惡，就該懼怕，因為他必將你繩之以法",{"noteId":56},"。他是上帝的僕人，代表上帝秉公行義，懲奸罰惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["所以，你們必須服從，不單是為了免受懲罰，也是為了良心無愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們納稅也是為了同樣的緣故，因為掌權的是上帝的僕人，負責管理這類事務。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡是人該得的，都要給他。該得糧的，就納糧給他；該得稅的，就繳稅給他；該懼怕的，就懼怕他；該尊敬的，就尊敬他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["愛鄰如己"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["凡事都不可虧欠人，但在彼此相愛方面要常常覺得虧欠。一個人愛別人，就成全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["因為「不可通姦、不可殺人、不可偷盜、不可貪心」",{"noteId":57},"以及其他誡命，都可以總結成一句話——「愛鄰如己」",{"noteId":58},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["愛不會作惡害人，所以愛成全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["還有，要知道現今是你們該睡醒的時候了！因為與初信的時候相比，我們得救的日子更近了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["黑夜已深，白晝將臨，我們要除掉黑暗的行為，穿上光明的盔甲",{"noteId":59},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我們要為人端正，光明磊落，不可荒宴醉酒，不可好色邪蕩，不可嫉妒紛爭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你們要活出主耶穌基督的榮美",{"noteId":60},"，不可放縱本性的私慾。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":56,"caller":"+","text":"「他必將你繩之以法」希臘文是「他佩劍，不只是作作樣子」。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":4}},{"noteId":57,"caller":"+","text":"出埃及記20·13‑15、17；申命記5·17‑19、21。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":58,"caller":"+","text":"利未記19·18。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":59,"caller":"+","text":"「穿上光明的盔甲」或譯「帶上光明的兵器」。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":12}},{"noteId":60,"caller":"+","text":"「活出主耶穌基督的榮美」希臘文是「穿上主耶穌基督」。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}